=99s most valuable companies, which is bound up with his family to an unusu=
al degree for Silicon Valley:</em></p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">For more than 30 years, Jensen Huang has b=
een the seemingly unshakable public face of Nvidia. He co-founded the compa=
ny as a young engineer in 1993 and oversaw its growth into a multitrillion =
dollar chipmaker and bellwether of the AI industry at large.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">He=E2=80=99s also made it a family busines=
s. His children, Madison and Spencer, have taken leadership roles at the fi=
rm. While not a company executive, his wife, Lori Mills Huang, leads the fa=
mily foundation which, as of 2024, controls over 60m Nvidia shares worth bi=
llions. The two married some 40 years ago. During public appearances, he=E2=
=80=99s fond of telling the story of how they met in college.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">But Huang=E2=80=99s image as a family man =
has been shattered as of Sunday. He admitted in a letter to employees on Su=
nday that he had been having an affair. Nvidia=E2=80=99s board of directors=
 have now launched an independent investigation about the national security=
 concerns surrounding Huang=E2=80=99s relationship.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">=E2=80=9CThroughout my life, my family has=
 given me love and support,=E2=80=9D Huang wrote in his letter. =E2=80=9CTh=
ey deserve my honesty and loyalty. Instead, I let them down and damaged the=
 life we built together. I take full responsibility for what I did and the =
hurt I caused, and I accept the criticism that comes with it.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">On one hand, Huang=E2=80=99s affair is not=
 just a matter of morals or ethics, as there are potential national securit=
y concerns. On the other, Huang is core to the DNA of Nvidia, which in turn=
 is the bedrock of the entire AI industry =E2=80=93 an industry upon which =
the US economy relies greatly. Huang himself may be too big to fail.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Investors are doubting what was once seen =
as an unstoppable juggernaut. Nvidia shares fell 7.5% as soon as the stock =
market opened, wiping over $330bn off the company=E2=80=99s value.</p>
